is uses b-tagged jets.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event reconstruction", "window": 1, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The specific features of heavy-flavored jets, in particular the presence of displaced vertices, are used in a multivariate jet tagging method.\", \"why\": \"The analysis uses b-tagged jets.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2201.11585", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": true, "quote": "The specific features of heavy-flavored jets, in particular the presence of displaced vertices, are used in a multivariate jet tagging method. The “medium” working point of the DeepCSV algorithm from Ref. [ 63 ] is used to tag b quark jets with pT>20 GeV and |η|<2.4 with 68% efficiency, and 1.1 (12)% probability of misidentifying a light-flavor or gluon (c quark) jet as a bottom quark jet.", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "The text mentions the use of a multivariate jet tagging method to tag b quark jets, which implies b-tagged jets.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event reconstruction", "window": 1, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The specific features of heavy-flavored jets, in particular the presence of displaced vertices, are used in a multivariate jet tagging method. The “medium” working point of the DeepCSV algorithm from Ref. [ 63 ] is used to tag b quark jets with pT>20 GeV and |η|<2.4 with 68% efficiency, and 1.1 (12)% probability of misidentifying a light-flavor or gluon (c quark) jet as a bottom quark jet.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions the use of a multivariate jet tagging method to tag b quark jets, which implies b-tagged jets.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2201.11585", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": true, "quote": "The specific features of heavy-flavored jets, in particular the presence of displaced vertices, are used in a multivariate jet tagging method.", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "The text mentions the use of a multivariate jet tagging method to identify heavy-flavored jets, which includes b-tagged jets.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event reconstruction", "window": 1, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The specific features of heavy-flavored jets, in particular the presence of displaced vertices, are used in a multivariate jet tagging method.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions the use of a multivariate jet tagging method to identify heavy-flavored jets, which includes b-tagged jets.\"}\n```"}]}
