agged.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 2, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Exactly two of the small- $R$ jets must be $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ -tagged.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that exactly two of the small- $R$ jets must be b-tagged.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 2, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Exactly two of the small- $R$ jets must be $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ -tagged.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that exactly two of the small- $R$ jets must be b-tagged.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": " + Abstract + Introduction + The CMS detector + Simulated samples", "window": 0, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The data analysis focuses on the final state with a charged lepton produced in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decay, two jets reconstructed from the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ decay, and significant missing transverse momentum ( $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ ) resulting from the LSPs and the neutrino.\", \"why\": \"The text specifies that the analysis focuses on events with jets reconstructed from the Higgs boson decay to bottom quarks and significant missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": " + Abstract + Introduction + The CMS detector + Simulated samples", "window": 0, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The data analysis focuses on the final state with a charged lepton produced in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decay, two jets reconstructed from the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ decay, and significant missing transverse momentum ( $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ ) resulting from the LSPs and the neutrino.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions the use of b-tagged jets (two jets reconstructed from the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ decay) and missing transverse momentum in the event selection.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": " + Abstract + Introduction + The CMS detector + Simulated samples", "window": 0, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\n  \"answer\": \"yes\",\n  \"quote\": \"The data analysis focuses on the final state with a charged lepton produced in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decay, two jets reconstructed from the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ decay, and significant missing transverse momentum ( $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ ) resulting from the LSPs and the neutrino.\",\n  \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions the use of b-tagged jets (two jets reconstructed from the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ decay) and missing transverse momentum.\"\n}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 1, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The analysis considers events with a single isolated electron or muon, two jets identified as originating from two bottom quarks, and large $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ from the LSPs and the neutrino.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that the analysis considers events with b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 1, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The analysis considers events with a single isolated electron or muon, two jets identified as originating from two bottom quarks, and large $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ from the LSPs and the neutrino.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states the analysis considers events with b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 1, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The analysis considers events with a single isolated electron or muon, two jets identified as originating from two bottom quarks, and large $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ from the LSPs and the neutrino.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states the event selection criteria include b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event selection and search strategy", "window": 2, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Exactly two of the small- $R$ jets must be $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ -tagged.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that exactly two of the small-R jets must be b-tagged.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "se