ts and missing transverse momentum in the context of event selection for this search.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Background estimation + Top quark background", "window": 3, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events containing top quarks constitute the dominant background, particularly in bins with $N_{\\text{jets}}=3$ or low $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ . These events contain $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets and isolated leptons from $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons, so they lead to similar final states as the signal.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum in the context of event selection for a search.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "$\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson background", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events from ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\text{+jets}$ production satisfy the baseline selection when they contain true $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets originating from ${\\mathup{{{g}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ (associated $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ production with heavy-flavor jets, ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\mathrm{+HF}$ ) or when light-flavor jets are misidentified as $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets (associated $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ production with light flavor jets, ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\text{+LF}$ ).\", \"why\": \"The text mentions that the event selection includes b-tagged jets.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "$\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson background", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events arising from $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson production, mainly ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\text{+jets}$ , $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ , and $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ , are the second largest background in this search and are the dominant SM contribution in bins with high $p_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ .\", \"why\": \"The text mentions that this analysis is a search and that it uses missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "$\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson background", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events from ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\text{+jets}$ production satisfy the baseline selection when they contain true $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets originating from ${\\mathup{{{g}}}}\\to{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ (associated $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ production with heavy-flavor jets, ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\mathrm{+HF}$ ) or when light-flavor jets are misidentified as $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ jets (associated $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ production with light flavor jets, ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{}\\text{+LF}$ ).\", \"why\": \"The text mentions that the analysis selects events with b-tagged jets.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results and interpretation + Summary", "window": 5, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"This paper presents the results of a search for chargino-neutralino production in a final state containing a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decaying to leptons, a Higgs boson decaying to a bottom quark-antiquark pair, and missing transverse momentum.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that the analysis is a search and mentions b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results and interpretation + Summary", "window": 5, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"This paper presents the results of a search for chargino-neutralino production in a final state containing a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decaying to leptons, a Higgs boson decaying to a bottom quark-antiquark pair, and missing transverse momentum.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that the analysis is a search and mentions the use of b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2107.12553", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Results and interpretation + Summary", "window": 5, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"This paper presents the results of a search for chargino-neutralino production in a final state containing a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson decaying to leptons, a Higgs boson decaying to a bottom quark-antiquark pair, and missing transverse momentum.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly states that the analysis is a search and mentions the use of b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}]}
