{"qid": "gf-01", "paper_id": "2307.01094", "answer": null, "unanimous": false, "quote": "The MC generators used to simulate the main SM processes of interest are summarised in Table 1 , together with the selected parton shower algorithms, the sets of tuned parameters (tunes), and the sets of parton distribution functions (PDF).", "answers": [], "votes": {"False": 2, "True": 1}, "escalated": false, "sections_read": ["ATLAS detector + Data and samples of simulated events"], "verdicts": [{"paper_id": "2307.01094", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": true, "quote": "b-tagged jets are used in the event selection process.", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text mentions the use of b-tagged jets in the event selection process.", "answer_text": "", "section": "ATLAS detector + Data and samples of simulated events", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"b-tagged jets are used in the event selection process.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions the use of b-tagged jets in the event selection process.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2307.01094", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": true, "quote": "The MC generators used to simulate the main SM processes of interest are summarised in Table 1 , together with the selected parton shower algorithms, the sets of tuned parameters (tunes), and the sets of parton distribution functions (PDF).", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "The text mentions the use of b-tagged jets in the context of simulated events and the search regions used in this analysis.", "answer_text": "", "section": "ATLAS detector + Data and samples of simulated events", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The MC generators used to simulate the main SM processes of interest are summarised in Table 1 , together with the selected parton shower algorithms, the sets of tuned parameters (tunes), and the sets of parton distribution functions (PDF).\", \"why\": \"The text mentions the use of b-tagged 