\"quote\": \"The reconstruction of the $ZH$ process proceeds through the identification of the leptons from the $Z$ boson, called $\\ell_{2}$ and $\\ell_{3}$ , as the SFOS lepton pair with invariant mass closest to the mass of the $Z$ boson. The remaining two leptons, labelled $\\ell_{0}$ and $\\ell_{1}$ , are candidates for originating from the Higgs boson decay.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions reconstructing the $ZH$ process by identifying leptons from the $Z$ boson and candidates for the Higgs boson decay.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2503.19420", "qid": "gf-05", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "$3\\ell$ channel + $4\\ell$ channel", "window": 5, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The reconstruction of the $ZH$ process proceeds through the identification of the leptons from the $Z$ boson, called $\\ell_{2}$ and $\\ell_{3}$ , as the SFOS lepton pair with invariant mass closest to the mass of the $Z$ boson.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions reconstructing the $ZH$ process.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2503.19420", "qid": "gf-05", "answer": true, "quote": "For each of the channels considered by the analysis, subregions of the corresponding SRs are defined which target the individual or pairs of the fiducial cross-sections above.", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "The text mentions defining subregions to target fiducial cross-sections, implying reconstruction of Higgs-boson candidates.", "answer_text": "", "section": "STXS categorisation", "window": 6, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"For each of the channels considered by the analysis, subregions of the corresponding SRs are defined which target the individual or pairs of the fiducial cross-sections above.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions defining subregions to target fiducial cross-sections, implying reconstruction of Higgs-boson candidates.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2503.19420", "qid": "gf-05", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "STXS categorisation", "window": 6, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"For the $3\\ell$ channel, a regression ANN is used to reconstruct the transverse momentum of the $W$ boson.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions reconstructing the transverse momentum of the W boson.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2503.19420", "qid": "gf-05", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "STXS categorisation", "window": 6, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"For the $3\\ell$ channel, a regression ANN is used to reconstruct the transverse momentum of the $W$ boson.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions reconstructing the transverse momentum of the $W$ boson.\"}\n```"}]}
