 \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The primary challenge of the searches in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ channel is separating the ${\\mathup{{{H}}}}{\\mathup{{{H}}}}$ signal from the overwhelming background and precisely modeling the background contribution in the analysis regions.\", \"why\": \"The paper mentions searches and the use of b-tagged jets (4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ channel)\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2604.27044", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": true, "quote": "The primary challenge of the searches in the 4 b channel is separating the HH signal from the overwhelming background and precisely modeling the background contribution in the analysis regions.", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "The text mentions searches and the use of b-tagged jets (4 b channel).", "answer_text": "", "section": "Introduction", "window": 1, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The primary challenge of the searches in the 4 b channel is separating the HH signal from the overwhelming background and precisely modeling the background contribution in the analysis regions.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions searches and the use of b-tagged jets (4 b channel).\"}\n```"}]}
