sive differential measurements of jet production cross sections + Inclusive $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ -flavoured jet production", "window": 7, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"In that publication jets are clustered from PF objects using the anti- $k_{\\mathrm{T}}$ algorithm with a distance parameter of $\\Delta R=0.5$ . The b-flavoured jets are selected using two methods. Both methods select reconstructed vertices displaced in three-dimensions from the PV using the SSV algorithm [ 33 ] . One method additionally requires one track associated with the secondary vertex be identified as a muon [ 34 ] .\", \"why\": \"The text describes the selection of b-flavoured jets using b-tagging methods.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2405.18661", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a search or event selection using b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Additional differential measurements of jet production cross sections + Proton PDFs + Overview of CMS constraints on PDFs + The PDF constraints from jet production measurements", "window": 8, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a search or event selection using b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2405.18661", "qid": "gf-01", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a search or event selection using b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Additional differential measurements of jet production cross sections + Proton PDFs + Overview of CMS constraints on PDFs + The PDF constraints from jet production measurements", "window": 8, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a search or event selection using b-tagged jets and missing