 events", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events with more than one jet with $p_{\\mathrm{T}}>40\\,\\text{Ge\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$ are rejected to reduce the $\\mathup{{{t}}}$ $\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}$ background, while still allowing for some hadronic recoil in signal events.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions rejecting events with more than one jet with $p_{\\mathrm{T}}>40\\,\\text{Ge\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$ to reduce the $\\mathup{{{t}}}$ $\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}$ background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2106.14246", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Same-sign dilepton events + Three-lepton events", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2106.14246", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Same-sign dilepton events + Three-lepton events", "window": 4, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"Events with more than one jet with $p_{\\mathrm{T}}>40\\,\\text{Ge\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$ are rejected to reduce the $\\mathup{{{t}}}$ $\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}$ background, while still allowing for some hadronic recoil in signal events.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions rejecting events to reduce the tt background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2106.14246", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Three light leptons with an OSSF pair", "windo