{"qid": "gf-07", "paper_id": "2404.06204", "answer": null, "unanimous": false, "quote": "Backgrounds from top-antitop-quark pair ( $t\bar{t}$ ) production and single-top-quark production ( $Wt$ associated production, $t$ -channel, $s$ -channel) were generated with Powheg + Pythia  8 [ 59 ] and normalised to the NNLO predictions with resummation at next-to-next-to-leading-logarithmic (NNLL) accuracy [ 60 , 61 , 62 , 63 , 64 , 65 , 66 ] .", "answers": [], "votes": {"False": 2, "True": 1}, "escalated": false, "sections_read": ["Signal and background simulation + Background estimates and event yields + Background in the $W\\rightarrow\\ell\\nu$ selection"], "verdicts": [{"paper_id": "2404.06204", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a control region used to normalise the ttZ background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Signal and background simulation + Background estimates and event yields + Background in the $W\\rightarrow\\ell\\nu$ selection", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a control region used to normalise the ttZ background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2404.06204", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a control region used to normalise the ttZ background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Signal and background simulation + Background estimates and event yields + Background in the $W\\rightarrow\\ell\\nu$ selection", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a control region used to normalise the ttZ background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2404.06204", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": true, "quote": "Backgrounds from top-antitop-quark pair ( $t\bar{t}$ ) production and single-top-quark production ( $Wt$ associated production, $t$ -channel, $s$ -channel) were g