": true, "quote": "The ttZ background is included in the analysis, with the ttZ(Z→cc) and ttZ(Z→bb) processes listed separately.", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text mentions ttZ background processes.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Neural network event classifier", "window": 13, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The ttZ background is included in the analysis, with the ttZ(Z→cc) and ttZ(Z→bb) processes listed separately.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions ttZ background processes.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2509.22535", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Neural network event classifier", "window": 13, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}({\\mathup{{{Z}}}}{\\to}{\\mathup{{{c}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{c}}}}}}}}}) 32  ± 27 210  ± 110 112  ± 65 360  ± 200\", \"why\": \"The text lists ttZ as a process with yields in different lepton channels.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2509.22535", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Systematic uncertainties + Experimental uncertainties", "window": 14, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"quote\": \"\", \"why\": \"The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2509.22535", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "The text does not mention a ttZ background or a control region used to normalise that background.", "answer_text": "", "section": "Systematic uncertainties + Experimental uncertainties", "window": 14, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"no\", \"