: true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The production rates of the signal processes and the normalization factors of the $\\mathup{{{t}}}$ $\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}$ background components are determined via a binned profile likelihood fit to data in all the SRs and CRs.\", \"why\": \"The text mentions the normalization of the ttZ background components.\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2509.22535", "qid": "gf-07", "answer": null, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Additional results", "window": 18, "escalated": true, "raw": "```json\n{\"answer\": \"yes\", \"quote\": \"The production rates of the signal processes and the normalization factors of the $\\mathup{{{t}}}$ $\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}$ background components are determined via a binned profile likelihood fit to data in all the SRs and CRs.\", \"why\": \"The text explicitly mentions a ttZ background and normalization factors for it.\"}\n```"}]}
